==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who [[play]]s tennis, especially [[professionally]].
#* '''2014''', Luke Russell, ''Evil: A Philosophical Investigation'' (page 166)
#*: By way of analogy, let us consider what it takes to be a good or bad '''tennis player'''. An extremely good '''tennis player''' must possess a mastery of the many different activities that are part of the game—serving, returning, and running around the court {{...}}

